    "sentence": "$f(-n-1) = 3(-n-1)^2 + 3(-n-1) + 7$\n$= 3(n^2+2n+1) - 3n - 3 + 7$\n$= 3n^2 + 6n + 3 - 3n + 4$\n$= 3n^2 + 3n + 7 = f(n)$.",
